    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21645" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάρος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ὁ</span>, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sauce</i> or <i>paste, made of brine and small
				fish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἰχθύων γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταριχηρὸς γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					606
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				280
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.18
			</span></i>; of the <i>fish</i> itself, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Podagr.</u>
				10
			</span></i> (Lat. version):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάρον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.6
			</span></i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ους</span>, τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				937.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
